            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Apples is a four-player trick-taking game with bidding, a chosen trump suit, target cards, and scoring from pairs, triples, and four-of-a-kind groups won in tricks.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Apples is documented as a modern standard-deck trick game related in feel to Hearts, Spades, and Bridge, but with its own bid pile and set-scoring system.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
